    "Answer A (Part-Time Default for Professional Degrees): Do a part-time program if you're pursuing a professional degree (MBA, MPA, MS) \u2014 you maintain income, apply learning immediately, avoid employment gaps, and outcomes are largely equivalent to full-time.",
    "Answer B (Full-Time for Immersion and Research): Go full-time if you can fund it \u2014 the peer network, research opportunities, and immersive experience are difficult to replicate part-time, and for research-based degrees full-time is essentially required.",
